      "lastGrade": "hard"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ed23df06b51876f73c187f3de",
      "videoId": "1e5GQGznvO4",
      "start": 180,
      "end": 187,
      "text": "My friend Molly's dad bought a sports car and now he lives in a studio apartment and dates a girl who works at",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T08:42:37.081Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T08:49:18.212Z",
      "level": 0,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T08:49:18.212Z",
      "reviewCount": 1,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T08:49:18.212Z",
      "lastGrade": "hard"
    },
    {
      "id": "249fc12159143b76d07020ad9b8",
      "videoId": "1e5GQGznvO4",
      "start": 280,
      "end": 288,
      "text": "I promise I'll take super good care of it. I promise I'll take super good care of",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T08:42:08.731Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T08:48:01.194Z",
      "level": 1,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T08:48:01.194Z",
      "reviewCount": 1,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T08:48:01.194Z",
      "lastGrade": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6c4a0e44cb70812f7b1c3fc5218",
      "videoId": "1e5GQGznvO4",
      "start": 295,
      "end": 303,
      "text": "It's just like last year when you wouldn't take off those skinny jeans. It's just like last year when you wouldn't take off those skinny jeans.",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T08:41:50.667Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T08:47:44.623Z",
      "level": 1,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T08:47:44.623Z",
      "reviewCount": 1,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T08:47:44.623Z",
      "lastGrade": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": "812fd08324fd4855cd41857cab08",
      "videoId": "EzgLDOkd-VM",
      "start": 36,
      "end": 42,
      "text": "Maybe this is my DNA talking, but you not seem sufficiently excited about the prospect of driving a new Cadillac.",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T08:41:07.302Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T08:47:28.710Z",
      "level": 1,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T08:47:28.710Z",
      "reviewCount": 1,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T08:47:28.710Z",
      "lastGrade": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6e14164e56e48165c8f19efa3e",
      "videoId": "EzgLDOkd-VM",
      "start": 60,
      "end": 67,
      "text": "Used to imagine the wind blowing through my perm, blasting some hauling oats, maybe horsing around with my Mr.",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T08:40:49.417Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T09:28:55.308Z",
      "level": 1,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T09:28:55.308Z",
      "reviewCount": 37,
      "lapseCount": 15,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T09:28:55.308Z",
      "lastGrade": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": "28d996f7fdb3f4c4a52eccbe9e8",
      "videoId": "EzgLDOkd-VM",
      "start": 146,
      "end": 154,
      "text": "This thing warns you if you deviate from your lane. In my car, that's my wife.",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T08:40:27.928Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T08:45:52.087Z",
      "level": 1,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T08:45:52.087Z",
      "reviewCount": 1,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T08:45:52.087Z",
      "lastGrade": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": "41d14b696c8d1812f62df0cbb2c8",
      "videoId": "EzgLDOkd-VM",
      "start": 360,
      "end": 367,
      "text": "You never see a person on their deathbed saying, \"I wish I'd have been more practical.\" I see a lot of people on their deathbed, Phil. You never see a",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T08:40:14.013Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T08:45:35.695Z",
      "level": 0,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T08:45:35.695Z",
      "reviewCount": 1,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T08:45:35.695Z",
      "lastGrade": "hard"
    },
    {
      "id": "db9cb3daa06d18d6b040a51f82c",
      "videoId": "SHonCnspSbo",
      "start": 30,
      "end": 36,
      "text": "Your name, sir. - Am I honestly to believe you do not already know my name? - I assure you, I am anything but interested in you.",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T04:25:09.609Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T08:44:34.484Z",
      "level": 1,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T08:44:34.483Z",
      "reviewCount": 1,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T08:44:34.483Z",
      "lastGrade": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": "696fee12aaba785fa37034dba08",
      "videoId": "SHonCnspSbo",
      "start": 136,
      "end": 139,
      "text": "How does one manage to make such a terribly unbecoming sound while laughing?",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T04:24:47.599Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-19T08:43:42.177Z",
      "level": 0,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-20T08:43:42.177Z",
      "reviewCount": 1,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-19T08:43:42.177Z",
      "lastGrade": "hard"
    },
    {
      "id": "34126ee5ce192d09bd66213e908",
      "videoId": "lM9V7QSyTNg",
      "start": 6,
      "end": 12,
      "text": "Oh, there you are. Was beginning to think that you and that old crow run off",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T04:05:39.180Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-20T05:03:28.298Z",
      "level": 1,
      "dueAt": "2026-02-21T05:03:28.297Z",
      "reviewCount": 2,
      "lapseCount": 0,
      "lastReviewedAt": "2026-02-20T05:03:28.297Z",
      "lastGrade": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": "26a9e77aff3f54357d531a7af5",
      "videoId": "lM9V7QSyTNg",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 27,
      "text": "Would you be a deal go out there and give them gals an eyeball?",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": "2026-02-19T04:04:36.828Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-20T05:03:08.854Z",
      "level": 1,
